<view class="page"><view class="title">表单设计</view><view>添加控件、调整顺序和必填项，导入导出 FormCreate 规则。预览输入只在本页显示，不提交业务数据；其他组件保留配置并显示类型。</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><view>字段标题</view><input value="{{label}}" data-key="label" bindinput="input"/><view>字段名（英文开头）</view><input value="{{field}}" data-key="field" bindinput="input"/><picker range="{{types}}" value="{{typeIndex}}" bindchange="chooseType"><view class="select">控件类型：{{type}}</view></picker><button bindtap="add">添加控件</button><view>规则 JSON</view><textarea value="{{rule}}" data-key="rule" bindinput="input" maxlength="-1"/><view>选项 JSON</view><textarea value="{{option}}" data-key="option" bindinput="input" maxlength="-1"/><button bindtap="check">校验并预览表单</button><view class="card" wx:for="{{preview}}" wx:key="index"><view class="title-small">{{item.index + 1}}. {{item.title}}{{item.required ? ' *' : ''}}</view><view class="caption">{{item.field}} · {{item.type}}</view><input wx:if="{{item.type === 'input'}}" value="{{item.value}}" disabled="{{item.disabled}}" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindinput="previewInput"/><textarea wx:elif="{{item.type === 'textarea'}}" value="{{item.value}}" disabled="{{item.disabled}}" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindinput="previewInput"/><picker wx:elif="{{item.type === 'select'}}" range="{{item.optionLabels}}" value="{{item.selected || 0}}" disabled="{{item.disabled || !item.options.length}}" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindchange="previewSelect"><view class="select">{{item.optionLabels[item.selected || 0] || '暂无选项，可在规则中配置 options'}}</view></picker><radio-group wx:elif="{{item.type === 'radio'}}"><label wx:for="{{item.options}}" wx:for-item="option" wx:key="value"><radio value="{{option.value}}" disabled="{{item.disabled}}"/>{{option.label}}</label></radio-group><checkbox-group wx:elif="{{item.type === 'checkbox'}}"><label wx:for="{{item.options}}" wx:for-item="option" wx:key="value"><checkbox value="{{option.value}}" disabled="{{item.disabled}}"/>{{option.label}}</label></checkbox-group><switch wx:elif="{{item.type === 'switch'}}" checked="{{item.checked}}" disabled="{{item.disabled}}"/><picker wx:elif="{{item.type === 'datePicker'}}" mode="date" value="{{item.value}}" disabled="{{item.disabled}}" data-index="{{item.index}}" bindchange="previewInput"><view class="select">{{item.value || '选择日期'}}</view></picker><view wx:else>此组件的配置已保留，请在规则JSON中编辑。</view><button size="mini" data-index="{{item.index}}" data-action="up" bindtap="arrange" disabled="{{item.index === 0}}">上移</button><button size="mini" data-index="{{item.index}}" data-action="down" bindtap="arrange" disabled="{{item.index === preview.length - 1}}">下移</button><button size="mini" data-index="{{item.index}}" data-action="required" bindtap="arrange" disabled="{{!item.field}}">{{item.required ? '取消必填' : '设为必填'}}</button><button size="mini" data-index="{{item.index}}" data-action="remove" bindtap="arrange">移除</button></view><button bindtap="importFile">导入 JSON 文件</button><button bindtap="exportFile">导出 JSON 文件</button><text selectable>{{result}}</text></view>
